                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kweli mimi nawabatiza kwa maji kwa ajili ya toba; bali yeye ajaye nyuma yangu ana nguvu kuliko mimi, wala sistahili hata kuvichukua viatu vyake; yeye atawabatiza kwa Roho Mtakatifu na kwa moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
